---
const GITHUB_URL = 'https://github.com/phandung2ea5d4-oss';
---

<section class="section contact" id="contact">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="contact-tag reveal-bounce" data-reveal-delay="0ms">CONTACT · 联系</span>
    <h2 class="section-title reveal-bounce" data-reveal-delay="80ms">想取得联系？</h2>
    <p class="section-desc contact-desc reveal-bounce" data-reveal-delay="160ms">
      对产品、Agent 或合作感兴趣——欢迎通过以下方式找到我。
    </p>

    <div class="contact-cards">
      <div class="contact-card reveal-bounce bounce-hover" data-reveal-delay="280ms">
        <span class="contact-card-label">PRIMARY · 第一入口</span>
        <div class="contact-card-body">
          <div>
            <h3 class="contact-card-title">
              <a href={GITHUB_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                GitHub · phandung2ea5d4-oss
              </a>
            </h3>
            <p class="contact-card-text">
              代码、项目更新与开源贡献。Auris 与 Knowcraft 的开发日志也会在这里同步。
            </p>
          </div>
          <a href={GITHUB_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="contact-btn">
            访问 GitHub →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-card reveal-bounce bounce-hover" data-reveal-delay="360ms">
        <span class="contact-card-label">WECHAT · 微信</span>
        <div class="contact-card-body">
          <div>
            <h3 class="contact-card-title">微信 · 落花流水</h3>
            <p class="contact-card-text">
              扫码添加好友，交流产品、Agent 或合作事宜。
            </p>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="contact-btn" data-wechat-modal>
            扫码关注 →
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-default);
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .contact-desc { margin-bottom: 48px; }

  .contact-cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .contact-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--border-default);
    padding: 48px;
  }

  .contact-card-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .contact-card-body {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .contact-card-title {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .contact-card-title a {
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .contact-card-title a:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .contact-card-text {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .contact-btn {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    border: 1px solid var(--text-primary);
    padding: 12px 24px;
    transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;
    white-space: nowrap;
    background: transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .contact-btn:hover {
    background: var(--text-primary);
    color: var(--bg-primary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .contact-card { padding: 32px 24px; }

    .contact-card-body {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>
